# Docker and Traefik

One process per container: `web`, `api`, `postgres`, Traefik, Mailpit. Traefik routes `/api` to the API and `/` to the web app.

Do not bake secrets into images. Pass them with env files that are gitignored. Health checks hit `/api/v1/health` and the web root.

```yaml
# BAD
image: api
environment:
  DATABASE_URL: postgres://user:real-secret@db/app
# GOOD
environment:
  DATABASE_URL: ${DATABASE_URL}
```
